This directory vendors the official Android HCCR runtime
(HCCRRecognizer, hccr_jni.cc) and the shared preprocess.c implementation.
The published NCNN INT8 model and charset (GB2312 Level-1, 3755 characters)
are bundled separately under app/src/main/assets/handwritten/.

CASIA HWDB1.1 raw training data is not redistributed.
